[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769913519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104883#issuecomment-2769913519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104883","id":2769913519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lGYav","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T16:22:17Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T16:22:50Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.5.dev 2303ce843 (Linux). In contrast, it works when using a MeshInstance3D with a primitive BoxMesh or an imported OBJ file as mesh.\n\ncc @smix8, as CSG mesh baking was implemented in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93252.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769913519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770228183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104883#issuecomment-2770228183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104883","id":2770228183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lHlPX","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T17:43:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T17:51:31Z","body":"The CSG bake copies the already created CSG internal root mesh, it does nothing on its own related to the mesh geometry data.\n\nThe occlusion baking only considers `MeshInstance3D` nodes that have a triangle `Mesh` resource with indices, aka array  `Mesh.ARRAY_INDEX` populated.\n\n**CSG meshes are not created with indices.**\n\nThe CSG meshes are all triangle meshes that have only\n\n- `Mesh.ARRAY_VERTEX`\n- `Mesh.ARRAY_NORMAL`\n- `Mesh.ARRAY_TEX_UV`\n\nAs such the occlusion baking parsed the node, but does only get the vertices array populated but not the indices array, so it rejects the node.\n\nSo options are to:\n- Change CSG to create root meshes that use indices by default, CC @fire \n- or make the CSG bake convert the entire mesh to a new mesh with indices using e.g. SurfaceTool.\n- or change the occlusion baking to not be so stubborn about needed mesh indices, could just reindex a non-indices mesh itself.\n- or remove the mention in the Occlusion doc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2770228183/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773340576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104883#issuecomment-2773340576","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104883","id":2773340576,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lTdGg","user":{"login":"DancingEngie","id":9748479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NDg0Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9748479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie","html_url":"https://github.com/DancingEngie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DancingEngie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T18:10:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T18:10:05Z","body":"If there are any gamedevs looking for an immediate workaround, this is what worked for me:\n\n1. Carve out your level as usual, making sure to keep all CSG geometry nodes separate from everything else. The easiest way to do that is to parent all of your CSG nodes to a Node3D.\n2. Copy your CSG geometry to a new 3D scene. Go to Scene -> Export as -> gltf 2.0 scene.\n3. Import the scene in Godot. If Godot doesn't recognize it for some reason, open the newly exported scene in Blender and re-export it as an .FBX or .GLB file.\n4. Place the baked model back in your main scene and bake its occlusion culling using the button at the top of the OccluderInstance3D viewport.\n\nThis is a roundabout way of doing things, and I'm not sure if it's particularly scalable. But it _works_, and it's a quick and dirty solution for the time being. That said, it would be extremely beneficial if this process was completely in-engine, as the docs imply.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773340576/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773361369","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104883#issuecomment-2773361369","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104883","id":2773361369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lTiLZ","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T18:19:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T18:19:47Z","body":"> Change CSG to create root meshes that use indices by default, CC @fire \n\nI wonder if this is hard. It doesn't sound hard...","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773361369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773361857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104883#issuecomment-2773361857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104883","id":2773361857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lTiTB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T18:19:53Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T18:19:53Z","body":"I think CSG bake should always create a mesh with indices, as it's more optimal this way.\n\nThat said, the occlusion baker should probably be able to handle non-indexed meshes as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773361857/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]